              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sonjagroset"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I brush the top of mine with an eggwash (1 egg beaten with a teaspoon of water). It gets lovely and golden brown on top. Be sure to let it cool for around 10 minutes to firm back up.",
            "datePublished": "2014-11-25T09:53:30.590Z"
