            },
            "reviewBody": "Used Puff Pastry from Allrecipes since TX went Armageddon mode again. Added apricot preserve, almonds, and agave since I didn’t have honey. Also used an egg wash. 400° for 30 minutes.",
            "datePublished": "2024-01-15T14:58:47.523Z"
          },
          {
