            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Brought to a party, great reviews. I sautéed apples and pears in butter and sugar. Placed on Brie and covered in pastry. Delicious but the some of the cheese spilled out. Next time I will put the Brie in the freezer for a bit so the crust and cheese cook at the same rate.",
            "datePublished": "2020-01-13T18:49:17.097Z"
