              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kathy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The recipe did not work for me. It took 45 minutes for the pastry to cook and brown. By then, the cheese melted in side too much. I think the oven temperature was too low. Also, the flavor was too bland. In my opinion, it needs a fruit jam/spread or some type of flavoring. I think the recipe would be great with some changes. Thank you for the recipe!! :)",
